Nature of this work
-------------------
This is a public-data technical proof by ParalleX Labs Inc. It is not a City of
Surrey system, has no connection to the City's ArcGIS Online, uses no City
credentials, and does not represent or claim any past or current work for the
City of Surrey. Heights shown are schematic estimates, never approved heights.
Application boundaries are not building footprints. The local version files
are demonstration corrections, not authentic City corrections.

Illustrative asset
------------------
The podium-and-tower object (40 m x 30 m x 15 m podium; 20 m x 20 m x 114 m
tower) was authored by ParalleX Labs Inc. for this proof, with fixed
illustrative dimensions. It is not derived from any City drawing, permit or
approved design, and is not a City or applicant building design.

